@startuml seq_hmi_context
title UDP context: independent lifelines and bounded work
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
participant "GameEvents / scene" as Game
participant "HmiContext\nUnity main thread" as Mod
participant "KrpcSource worker" as HMI
participant "Display thread" as UI
participant "kspsim context server\n(alternative endpoint)" as Sim
activate Game
Game -> Mod : facility spawn/despawn callback
activate Mod
Mod -> Mod : update remembered facility
Mod --> Game : callback complete
deactivate Mod
deactivate Game
activate HMI
HMI ->> Mod : UDP 50002: KSPHMI/1
activate Mod
Mod -> Mod : Update(): process at most 4 requests
Mod -->> HMI : UDP: KSPHMI/1 mission_control
deactivate Mod
HMI -> HMI : parse context and publish Snapshot
deactivate HMI
activate UI
UI -> UI : read latest Snapshot\ndraw facility view
deactivate UI
note over HMI : Receive timeout 150 ms on source worker.\nContext refreshed about once per second.
== Simulator replaces the production endpoint ==
activate HMI
HMI ->> Sim : UDP 50002: KSPHMI/1
activate Sim
Sim -->> HMI : UDP: KSPHMI/1 flight skin=apollo
deactivate Sim
HMI -> HMI : publish Snapshot.skin=apollo
deactivate HMI
activate UI
UI -> UI : draw Snapshot\napply known skin override
deactivate UI
note over Mod : Production replies do not override skins.
@enduml
